an impossible feat.

7
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:48,634
The safe is made of
the strongest iron.

8
00:00:48,678 --> 00:00:51,898
It can't be sawed
through or pried.

9
00:00:51,942 --> 00:00:56,251
Yet, Lionel Shrike thinks
he's able to escape.

10
00:00:56,294 --> 00:00:58,122
Dad! Dad!

11
