Hey, buddy.

12
00:01:01,169 --> 00:01:02,953
You made it, huh?

13
00:01:02,996 --> 00:01:06,391
Now, see that seat there?

14
00:01:06,435 --> 00:01:08,089
It's the best
seat in the house.

15
00:01:08,132 --> 00:01:12,267
Is Lionel Shrike
the kind of magician
who can pull this off?

16
00:01:12,310 --> 00:01:15,226
