something up my sleeve.

25
00:01:32,591 --> 00:01:34,680
Now, got your watch
like your dad's?

26
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:37,248
Okay. How many seconds?

27
00:01:37,292 --> 00:01:38,858
300.

28
00:01:38,902 --> 00:01:40,382
300. Maybe a few less.

29
00:01:42,906 --> 00:01:44,473
Mmm.

30
00:01:44,516 --> 00:01:46,170
I love you so much.

31
00:01:48,041 --> 00:01:50,957
