00:02:21,031 --> 00:02:23,164
296...

41
00:02:23,207 --> 00:02:28,212
297, 298, 299, 300.

42
00:02:31,476 --> 00:02:34,262
303, 304...

43
00:02:35,350 --> 00:02:36,394
THADDEUS:
It's five minutes now,

44
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:42,487
