seen or heard anything
from Lionel Shrike yet.

45
00:02:42,531 --> 00:02:43,749
Move!

46
00:02:43,793 --> 00:02:45,055
[CROWD MURMURING]

47
00:02:45,098 --> 00:02:46,187
Dad!

48
00:02:46,230 --> 00:02:47,405
[AMBULANCE SIREN WAILING]

49
00:02:47,449 --> 00:02:49,929
Dad! Dad!

50
00:02:51,844 --> 00:02:53,194
Let go of me!

51
00:02:54,107 --> 00:02:55,239
Dad!

52
00:02:56,501 --> 00:02:57,589
