Find him!

55
00:03:05,728 --> 00:03:06,990
[INAUDIBLE]

56
00:03:24,050 --> 00:03:25,226
THADDEUS:  The Eye.

57
00:03:26,052 --> 00:03:28,011
It may not lie...

58
00:03:28,054 --> 00:03:31,536
But don't think for a moment
that it can't be lied to.

59
00:03:33,321 --> 00:03:36,237
Seeing is believing.

60
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,239
But is it truth?

61
00:03:38,282 --> 00:03:41,546
People see the Horsemen
as noble Robin Hoods.

62
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:42,765
Are they?

63
00:03:42,808 --> 00:03:46,029
Or are they common thieves?

64
00:03:46,072 --> 00:03:47,378
Depends on your point of view.

65
00:03:48,597 --> 00:03:50,251
Here's what you know.

66
00:03:50,294 --> 00:03:53,819
They robbed a bank in Paris
from a stage in Las Vegas.

67
00:03:53,863 --> 00:03:55,473
They fleeced
an insurance magnate

68
00:03:55,517 --> 00:03:57,170
