millions of dollars

69
00:03:57,214 --> 00:03:59,869
and disappeared from
a roof in New York.

70
00:03:59,912 --> 00:04:04,134
Always showering their
devoted fans with money.

71
00:04:04,177 --> 00:04:06,092
Here's what you don't know.

72
00:04:06,136 --> 00:04:08,312
They left one man behind.

73
00:04:08,356 --> 00:04:10,183
Framed. Holding the bag.

74
00:04:11,054 --> 00:04:12,055
Me.

75
00:04:13,665 --> 00:04:15,754
Are you listening, Horsemen?

76
00:04:15,798 --> 00:04:18,975
When you emerge,
and you will...

77
00:04:20,150 --> 00:04:23,153
