what's coming to you.

80
00:04:28,463 --> 00:04:30,900
In ways you can't expect.

81
00:04:31,988 --> 00:04:34,469
But very much deserve.

82
00:04:34,512 --> 00:04:37,472
Because one thing
I believe in

83
00:04:37,515 --> 00:04:40,779
is any eye for an eye.

84
00:05:09,373 --> 00:05:10,722
