You've asked many questions.

90
00:06:08,998 --> 00:06:11,435
And registered
many complaints.

91
00:06:11,479 --> 00:06:13,524
You can rest assured
that we've heard you.

92
00:06:13,568 --> 00:06:15,178
Have you? Because I don't...[WHISPERING VOICES]

93
00:06:15,221 --> 00:06:16,571
