94
00:06:19,443 --> 00:06:21,053
Perhaps even us?

95
00:06:21,097 --> 00:06:24,970
I don't like
that we've been living
in hiding for a year.

96
00:06:25,014 --> 00:06:27,277
I don't like
that every message
I get from Dylan is,

97
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,670
"Wait. Be patient.

98
00:06:28,713 --> 00:06:29,975
