99
00:06:30,019 --> 00:06:32,456
Wait. Be patient.[CHUCKLES DRYLY]

100
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:33,718
The Eye has a plan.

101
00:06:33,762 --> 00:06:36,808
This is games and
it's not working for me.

102
00:06:36,852 --> 00:06:38,810
