...when in fact
I mean something else.

501
00:21:32,921 --> 00:21:34,139
...when in fact

502
00:21:35,663 --> 00:21:37,099
I mean something else.

503
00:21:37,142 --> 00:21:38,448
What else do I mean?

504
00:21:38,492 --> 00:21:42,365
Well, here to fill
you in on some of my

505
